# Two containers, two LaunchAgents, ~/romd-data, 4 ROMD_ROMM_* secrets in
# ~/.secrets — the whole stack is absent from infra.md as of 2026-08-09.
127.0.0.1:21847    # romd — RomM, reached through a colima/lima ssh forward
127.0.0.1:21848    # romd — cappedproxy (com.zig.romd-cappedproxy)
# 100.72.47.4:21847  tailscale-serve in front of RomM. DOCUMENTED, NOT ASSERTED:
#                    it is owned by root (tailscaled), so a non-privileged lsof
#                    cannot see it and listing it would make this checker report
#                    a permanently-GONE listener. Listed here so the third port
#                    from the audit is written down somewhere; watching it needs
#                    a privileged probe, which is a different (and non-read-only)
#                    decision.
